  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "3 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "1.5 teaspoons ground black pepper",
    "2 tablespoons garlic powder, divided",
    "1 lemon, juiced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hZXstV9BOUtotvJ1giLlD4Jw2cM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240993-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-01-2-3a4badb6cc8846869cf69c60f40ef97a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240993/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a skillet over medium-high heat. Season chicken with salt and pepper; place in melted butter. Cook chicken, flipping frequently, until browned, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/n27Xf1TUBF2h3oXQbiQmtlqNy2s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240993-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-02-bf4e08f05c814fde96de6b44ed512bf3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240993/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle 1 tablespoon garlic powder over chicken; cook for 2 minutes. Flip and sprinkle remaining 1 tablespoon garlic powder on the second side; cook for 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E4a3KXxDtlKdzXkFk2qd9n7NUGA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240993-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-03-39053b118aa84d508d99a191de9b5c4e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240993/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour lemon juice over each side of chicken and cook until no longer pink in the center, 5 to 10 minutes more. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8hOZfsTnlqf8n4f9Ah-1DCmQky4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240993-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-04-afc3aa52c2b74cbf817f3aa6bbd29833.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240993/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
